#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Runtime {#install-qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr "Instalar Qiskit Runtime {#install-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install Qiskit Runtime:\n"
msgstr "Sigue estos pasos para instalar Qiskit Runtime:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the Qiskit Runtime repository.\n"
msgstr "Clona el repositorio de Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` directory.\n"
msgstr "Cambia al directorio `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install `qiskit-runtime`. We recommend using a [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting"
" your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Instala `qiskit-runtime`. Recomendamos usar un [entorno "
"virtual](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) para evitar contaminar"
" tu instalación global de Python.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**Instalación estándar**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when "
"there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Modo editable**: En este modo, no necesitas reinstalar Qiskit cuando haya "
"cambios de código en el proyecto.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ "
"without optimizations.\n"
msgstr ""
"    En modo editable, las extensiones compiladas se construyen en _modo de "
"depuración_ sin optimizaciones.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer"
" requirements. We recommend using a [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting"
" your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr ""
"(Opcional) Si quieres ejecutar pruebas o verificaciones de linting, instala "
"los requisitos de desarrollador. Recomendamos usar un [entorno "
"virtual](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) para evitar contaminar"
" tu instalación global de Python.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Próximos pasos {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendaciones\">\n"
"  - Lee las [directrices de contribución](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) para contribuir a `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Instala el SDK de Qiskit desde el código fuente](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Ejecuta tu primer programa](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Prueba un tutorial, como [el algoritmo de Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
